    "text": "If the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math> is equal to"
