  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math><br />For&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>27</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;to be finite<br /><math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
